{'symbol': 'CSX', 'date': '2021-09-20 10:00:00', 'title': 'CSX JOINS RAIL SAFETY PARTNERS IN WEEKLONG AWARENESS BLITZ TO #STOPTRACKTRAGEDIES', 'text': 'JACKSONVILLE, FLA., SEPT. 20, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- CSX (NASDAQ: CSX) JOINS OPERATION LIFESAVER, INC. (OLI), OPERATION LIFESAVER CANADA AND THE MEXICAN ASSOCIATION OF RAILROADS (AMF) TO HELP STOP TRAGEDIES AROUND RAILROAD TRACKS AND TRAINS BY OBSERVING RAIL SAFETY WEEK ACROSS NORTH AMERICA, SEPTEMBER 20-26. THIS ANNUAL WEEKLONG EFFORT CONCENTRATES PUBLIC ATTENTION ON THE NEED FOR RAIL SAFETY EDUCATION AND SAVES LIVES BY EDUCATING AND EMPOWERING THE PUBLIC TO MAKE SAFE DECISIONS AROUND TRACKS AND TRAINS.'}